lic, on request, by fax or mail. 24. (1) The summary shall : (a)subject to subsection (3), set out the source and nature, but not the value, of the income, assets and liabilities referred to in the Member’s statement filed under section 20;(b) identify any contracts or subcontracts referred to in paragraph 21(1)(c) and describe their subject-matter and nature;(c) list the names of any affiliated corporations referred to in that statement; (d) include a copy of any statements of disclosure filed by the Member under subsections 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Fraser Tolmie · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date June 2, 2026 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description LiabilitiesMortgage with B2B BankLine of credit with CIBCVISA Credit Card with CIBC Disclosed on June 2, 2026","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=90055997-fe59-f111-81a8-001dd8b72449"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":138,"first":"2021-11-08","last":"2026-09-28","byYear":{"2021":4,"2022":36,"2023":28,"2024":34,"2025":17,"2026":19},"topSubjects":[["Agriculture",45],["Infrastructure",28],["Environment",25],["Health",24],["Municipalities",22],["Climate",20],["Budget",19],["Telecommunications",18]],"topOrgs":[["Saskatchewan Association of Rural Municipalities",28],["SaskMilk (Saskatchewan Milk Marketing Board)",7],["Nutrien Ltd.",6],["Saskatchewan Polytechnic",6],["Saskatchewan Milk Marketing Board",5],["Chicken Farmers of Canada",5],["Canadian Cattle Association",4],["MS Canada",4]]}}